 "summary": "One FMGC failing leaves the other running everything (single mode): recover the AP on the other side, put both NDs on the same range and mode, and reset the failed FMGC from the QRH. Both FMGCs failing drops AP/FD and A/THR: try to re-engage them, otherwise fly manual thrust with FDs off and TRK/FPA, tune navaids on the RMPs, reset per QRH, and use MCDU BACK UP NAV.",
